  "description": "A lightweight .NET weak event manager for weak event subscriptions with synchronous and asynchronous handlers. Instance subscribers are held by weak references, allowing the garbage collector to reclaim unused objects and prevent memory leaks in applications such as Blazor. Supports events with or without data and cancellation-aware publishing.",
